SUMMARY:Free Period Pantry Ribbon Cutting
DESCRIPTION:Join the Diaper Bank of North Carolina for the ribbon cutting of their new free period pantry on June 10 at 3pm. Located at 3218 N Roxboro Street\, the pantry will provide free period products for anyone who needs them.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/free-period-pantry-ribbon-cutting/
LOCATION:3218 N Roxboro Street\, 3218 N Roxboro St\, Durham\, NC\, 27704\, United States
END:VEVENT
