SUMMARY:OUT! on the Block
DESCRIPTION:Join the LGBTQ Center of Durham on Saturday\, June 13 from 10am-3pm for OUT! on the Block\, a Pride festival for kids\, youth\, and families. Activities and fun for kids 0-24 (and their families) including drag\, face painting\, arts and crafts\, performances\, and more.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/out-on-the-block/
LOCATION:LGBTQ Center of Durham\, 114 Hunt Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
